          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            For purposes of this page, a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fork"} fork
            (some might say a “cofork”) in a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi C
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
            is a diagram of the form
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %munderover
                    %mo ⇉
                    %mi f
                    %mi g
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mi B
                  %mover
                    %mo →
                    %mi e
                  %mi C
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \;\underoverset{f}{g}{\rightrightarrows}\; B \overset{e}{\rightarrow} C
          %p
            such that
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi e
                    %mi f
                    %mo =
                    %mi e
                    %mi g
